---
title: ":pancakes: Pumpkin Pancakes"
source: Recipe Box
servings: 4
prep time: 5 minutes
cook time: 15 minutes
total time: 20 minutes
tags:
  - breakfast
  - pancake
  - pumpkin
  - recipe-box
  - vegetarian
---

In a #large mixing bowl{}, combine @biscuit mix{2%cups}, @packed light brown sugar{2%Tbsp}, @ground cinnamon{2%tsp}, and @ground allspice{1%tsp}.

Add @evaporated milk{1.5%cups}, @pumpkin puree{1/2%cup}, @vegetable oil{2%Tbsp}, @eggs{2}, and @vanilla extract{1%tsp}. Beat until smooth.

Pour 1/4 to 1/2 cup batter onto a heated and lightly greased #griddle{}. Cook until top surface is bubbly and edges are dry, 2 to ~{3%minutes}. Flip and cook until golden brown on the other side, 1 to ~{2%minutes}.
